WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.734
This morning

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:01.534
Ukrainian forces

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.403
destroying all ten missiles,

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:05.105
a targeting key.

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.539
Also reporting, however, that falling

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:07.507
debris has resulted

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:09.709
in the deaths of a nine year old girl.

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.611
Her mother and another woman.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.012
Ukraine's

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.113
minister of internal affairs

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.415
says all three deaths were tied.

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:16.649
All three, rather,

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.451
tried to enter a bomb shelter

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.753
that was closed

00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:20.253
You may recall

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.755
Russian President Vladimir Putin has

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.490
said he launched this invasion

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.492
to stop Naito from getting closer

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:26.593
to the Russian border.

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:27.360
Now NATO's

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.862
secretary general

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:29.696
Stoltenberg says

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.098
that is exactly what will happen

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.502
as late as last year.

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:36.436
All the allies agreed

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:37.637
that Ukraine will become a member

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:38.905
of this alliance.

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:41.007
And and we are making

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:43.843
concrete steps because Ukraine is moving

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.578
towards NATO's

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:46.546
meaning that they are coming

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.814
closer and closer,

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:49.249
meaning that they are

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:51.384
moving from the Soviet standards

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.887
to NATO's standards, equipment, doctrines

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.722
and we are helping them

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:57.090
doing that as we speak.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:00:58.992
CNN's Sam

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:00.393
Kiley joining us this morning

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.261
live in eastern

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:03.163
Ukraine with more on this.

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:03.830
So first, Sam,

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.131
let's talk about those attacks

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.433
overnight on key.

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.601
What more are we learning

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:11.938
Well, we understand, Erica,

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:13.273
that these

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:15.241
ten missiles were shot down

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.043
over the Ukrainian capital

00:01:17.043 --> 00:01:18.711
after a brief sort of nearly

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:19.979
a day long lull in which

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.147
there have been no attacks.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.649
That was the first day

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:23.950
that there had been no attacks, more

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:26.019
or less for about two weeks

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.320
in the Ukrainian capital,

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.489
which has been the focus of attention

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:31.558
of the Russian bombardment.

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:33.793
But tragically, three people killed

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:35.228
and a number.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:36.463
Well, they were all killed

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:37.897
and a large number injured

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.165
when they found themselves

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:42.702
locked out of a significant bunker.

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:44.604
Now, these are Soviet era bunkers

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:46.539
that are built around the city

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:48.241
very frequently close

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.242
to underneath

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:51.778
the tower blocks in a residential blocks.

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:53.313
But for reasons

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:54.747
that are now subject

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:55.081
of an

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:56.916
official investigation

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.185
in Kiev, more than a year after the war,

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:00.687
somebody had locked the door,

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:02.222
trapping people outside.

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:03.423
And then tragically,

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:05.525
they were hit by debris

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.360
descending this hill, coming on a day

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.095
in which the Russians continue

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:10.463
to be under pressure to,

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.599
they are saying in Belgorod Province

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.033
in the south of Russia,

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.203
on the northern border with Ukraine, that

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:19.005
a large number of villages along

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:21.241
the border are being evacuated.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:22.509
More than 300 children,

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:24.010
they're talking about evacuating,

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.645
evacuating women.

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.180
And that's because a number of towns,

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.014
they claim

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:28.715
are being hit

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:31.017
currently with Ukrainian artillery

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.152
and mortars.

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:33.987
And this is now part of a new pattern

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:35.088
of cross-border

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:37.624
operations being conducted by Ukraine.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:38.791
Into Russia.

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:40.927
They had been extremely rare in the past.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:43.229
Now they're becoming more routines.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:44.797
You're seeing a lot more of this

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:46.299
tit for tat effects

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:47.200
on civilians

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.135
on both sides of this conflict.

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:51.304
So there's the tit for tat aspect of it.

00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:52.372
And then there is also

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:53.873
what we could potentially see

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:55.108
on the heels of these comments

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:55.708
from Stoltenberg,

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.043
saying that NATO's members agree

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:58.912
Ukraine should be a member.

00:02:58.912 --> 00:02:59.812
What is the sense

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:00.413
this morning

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:00.980
in terms

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.149
of what that could prompt

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:04.817
in terms of attacks from Russia?

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:08.821
I don't think the

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:09.722
Russians have

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:11.257
a great deal in their armory

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.959
that would be

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:15.762
deployed in some kind of response to this

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:16.896
sort of event.

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:17.730
It's always a mistake

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.566
to think that people,

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:20.500
when they're prosecuting

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:20.867
a war,

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:22.335
will react to anniversaries

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:24.270
or retaliate in kind for certain acts.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.738
They prosecute,

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:28.007
prosecuting an ongoing campaign here.

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:31.077
They will use this

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:33.213
statement coming from you and Stoltenberg

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.480
domestically in the Kremlin

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.349
to kind of prove their point

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:37.717
to the Russian population

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:39.018
that they needed to go to war

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:41.421
to prevent Naito doing just this.

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:42.722
And then it'll be up to the Russians

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:44.123
to decide whether or not

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:45.792
the Ukraine's closeness

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:47.894
to Naito is a consequence

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:49.762
of the Russian invasion

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:51.364
rather than anything else.

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.131
Sam Kiley

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:53.433
live for us in Ukraine this morning.

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:54.000
Thank you.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:54.801
A new front

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.603
opening in Moscow's war on Ukraine

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:58.238
with cross-border attacks

00:03:58.238 --> 00:03:59.005
bringing the battle

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:00.240
to the Russian people.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.242
Meantime, a terrifying night in Kiev.

00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:02.642
The mayor

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:03.042
there says

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:04.677
at least three people are dead.

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:06.246
14 injured in missile

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:07.981
strikes on the capital.

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:09.682
It follows days of artillery attacks

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:11.551
just inside Russia.

00:04:11.551 --> 00:04:12.986
The governor of the Belgorod

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:13.586
region says

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:14.988
hundreds of women and children

00:04:14.988 --> 00:04:16.856
are being evacuated now.

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:19.559
CNN's Clare Sebastian is live in London.

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:20.059
And Clare,

00:04:20.059 --> 00:04:21.494
Kiev is not claiming responsibility

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:22.161
for those attacks,

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:23.162
but could this be

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:24.330
a turning point in the war?

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:26.933
If it's a turning point?

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:28.568
It's not clear just yet, Christine,

00:04:28.568 --> 00:04:29.302
but it does feel like

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:31.371
this is a new phase in the war.

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:32.905
We have seen sporadic

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:34.140
shelling over the border

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.208
in the Belgorod region

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:36.109
since the beginning,

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:38.344
but the uptick has been significant

00:04:38.344 --> 00:04:40.146
in recent days and weeks.

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:40.580
As you said,

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.582
more shelling reported this morning.

00:04:42.582 --> 00:04:43.583
A number of injuries

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:45.885
reported by the governor there.

00:04:45.918 --> 00:04:47.020
The impact as well on people

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:47.987
living there with

00:04:47.987 --> 00:04:49.022
with the constant

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:50.857
threat of injury and death.

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:53.092
Children, as you say, in the hundreds

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:54.694
being evacuated this morning.

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:55.361
We had

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:56.462
they've canceled

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:59.065
sort of state school exams because of

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:00.500
the violence there.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.670
So it is impacting people in that region.

00:05:03.703 --> 00:05:05.138
The Kremlin has called the situation

00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:06.105
rather alarming.

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:07.273
And separately this morning,

00:05:07.273 --> 00:05:07.607
Christine,

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:08.174
we're hearing from

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:10.043
both of those two groups

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:11.444
who were responsible for that

00:05:11.444 --> 00:05:13.813
pretty violent incursion into Belgorod.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.481
Just a week or so ago.

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:16.182
One of them says

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:18.251
they are already back on Russian soil.

00:05:18.284 --> 00:05:19.285
The other says

00:05:19.285 --> 00:05:20.687
they're close to the border.

00:05:20.687 --> 00:05:22.021
We've not been able to verify this.

00:05:22.021 --> 00:05:23.089
And the governor of the Belgorod

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:24.724
region says that the enemy

00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:27.360
is not on his territory at the moment.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:27.960
But they, as you

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:28.928
remember, were responsible

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:30.363
for really the first bout

00:05:30.363 --> 00:05:32.231
that we've seen of actual physical

00:05:32.231 --> 00:05:33.733
fighting on Russian soil

00:05:33.733 --> 00:05:36.102
since the beginning of this war.

00:05:36.135 --> 00:05:38.538
So clearly, this is a new phase.

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:39.572
It's not just Belgorod.

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:40.273
We've seen repeated

00:05:40.273 --> 00:05:40.940
drone attacks

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.742
as far north as the Barents region,

00:05:42.742 --> 00:05:44.043
which is north of Kiev,

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:45.211
down to Krasnodar.

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:47.947
Two oil refineries affected on Wednesday.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:48.848
So this war

00:05:48.848 --> 00:05:49.916
that was already being

00:05:49.916 --> 00:05:52.318
fought over a very wide area,

00:05:52.318 --> 00:05:54.554
it seems that the scope has now widened

00:05:54.554 --> 00:05:55.955
even further. Christine.

00:05:55.955 --> 00:05:57.123
And the Ukrainian government

00:05:57.123 --> 00:05:58.891
is not taking responsibility, right?

00:06:00.126 --> 00:06:01.561
They are not explicitly

00:06:01.561 --> 00:06:02.562
taking responsibility

00:06:02.562 --> 00:06:03.663
but certainly

00:06:03.663 --> 00:06:04.464
there have been hints

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:05.398
of presidential adviser

00:06:05.398 --> 00:06:06.132
calling,

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:06.632
for example,

00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:07.734
the drone attack on Moscow,

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:09.535
Russia's karmic payment,

00:06:09.535 --> 00:06:10.203
and promising

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:10.970
more attacks

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.138
like this, but explicitly

00:06:12.138 --> 00:06:13.406
no claim of responsibility.

00:06:13.406 --> 00:06:13.873
And the U.S.

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:14.640
Pentagon has said

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.543
it is counterproductive to be

00:06:17.543 --> 00:06:19.712
to be attacking inside Russia.

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:20.313
All right.

00:06:20.313 --> 00:06:21.681
Clare Sebastian, thank you so much.

